  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-description\">\n  <p class=\"product-summary\">The Nolita 19 is your go-to, everyday shoulder bag. Crafted of crocodile-embossed leather, it is durable and compact. With enough space to carry your keys, card case, and iPhone (Up to 16 Pro Max), this mini clutch bag keeps your essentials close at hand. Featuring two credit card slots for added organization, the Nolita can be customized with bag charms or a different strap for a personal touch. Wear it on your shoulder to complete your outfit or carry it as a wristlet when you&#x27;re on the go. No matter the occasion, this mini leather bag can adapt to your look.</p>\n  \n  <div class=\"product-highlights\">\n    <h4>Product Specifications</h4>\n    <ul>\n      <li><strong>Material:</strong> Crocodile-embossed leather and smooth leather</li>\n      <li><strong>Lining:</strong> Fabric lining</li>\n      <li><strong>Closure:</strong> Zip-top closure</li>\n      <li><strong>Organization:</strong> Inside multifunction pocket</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n\n  <details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top: 15px; border: 1px solid #e5e5e5; border-radius: 6px; padding: 10px;\">\n    <summary style=\"font-weight: bold; cursor: pointer;\">📏 Size & Measurement Guide</summary>\n    <table style=\"width: 100%; margin-top: 10px; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n      <tbody>\n        <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;\">\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px; font-weight: 600;\">Dimensions (L x H x W)</td>\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px;\">N/A</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;\">\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px; font-weight: 600;\">Handle Drop</td>\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px;\">Handle with 6.25&quot; drop</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px; font-weight: 600;\">Shoulder / Crossbody Strap Drop</td>\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px;\">N/A</td>\n        </tr>\n   